e for connected operation.",{"_57":148,"_173":-5,"_166":109,"_174":-5,"_175":386},{"_103":109,"_174":-5,"_177":-5,"_178":171},{"_143":388,"_139":182,"_183":389,"_185":186,"_187":390,"_189":391,"_191":392,"_193":393,"_195":394,"_197":395,"_199":396},"c50c4c9d-55bb-4423-8c3e-781ffff460bb","2025040937453857.jpg",161037,"8851b0c528aa8f3f11bac4d54c4a5ffd8e6ba0b79e7a6a527d4c31805dbb2c25",439,577,"/igenu-preview/media/8851b0c528aa8f3f11bac4d5.png","2026-10-20T17:32:39.818Z",[397,400],{"_191":202,"_193":398,"_185":204,"_195":399},421,"/igenu-preview/media/a94dedbc4c305ed00e17532e.webp",{"_191":392,"_193":393,"_185":204,"_195":401},"/igenu-preview/media/addc2737c9f6397359f3a546.webp",{"_143":403,"_139":145,"_57":404,"_147":148,"_103":405,"_150":406,"_152":-5,"_153":-5,"_154":407,"_58":409},"64a8c7a0-6009-4293-be1b-c7946d92070c","conductivity","Conductivity","Explore related instruments for conductivity measurement.",[408,159,160],"f33fa081-7e09-4283-a1f0-899eb8c5a37c",[162,238,410],{"_143":408,"_57":411,"_164":412,"_166":413,"_168":414,"_170":243,"_147":415,"_179":417},"ig30cds","IG30CDS","IG30CDS Conductivity Sensor","Measure conductivity in water treatment and industrial process water with a choice of cell constants. Digital communication and stored calibration settings support system integration and routine operation, while the supplied mounting arrangement and flow cell simplify installation.",{"_57":148,"_173":-5,"_166":109,"_174":-5,"_175":416},{"_103":109,"_174":-5,"_177":-5,"_178":171},{"_143":418,"_139":182,"_183":419,"_185":225,"_187":420,"_189":421,"_191":422,"_193":422,"_195":423,"_197":424,"_199":425},"97568f30-f32e-4d9a-85ac-2b57a8967181","2025040860050401.jpg",57217,"08cc865f38c95a6b72364eaf3f6b94912df92297b7cb4dbcdb9d9d327b79dd1c",500,"/igenu-preview/media/08cc865f38c95a6b72364eaf.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.763Z",[426,428],{"_191":202,"_193":202,"_185":204,"_195":427},"/igenu-preview/media/6f7c525ac57d10f270f2e15f.webp",{"_191":422,"_193":422,"_185":204,"_195"