","IG30OL Oil-in-Water Sensor","Ultraviolet fluorescence detects oil in water for applications including petrochemical wastewater and oilfield reinjection monitoring. Optical filtering and a self-cleaning arrangement help manage measurement interference and deposits, while digital communication connects the probe to monitoring systems.",{"_57":148,"_173":-5,"_166":109,"_174":-5,"_175":593},{"_103":109,"_174":-5,"_177":-5,"_178":171},{"_143":496,"_139":182,"_183":497,"_185":225,"_187":498,"_189":499,"_191":251,"_193":251,"_195":500,"_197":501,"_199":595},[596,597],{"_191":202,"_193":202,"_185":204,"_195":504},{"_191":251,"_193":251,"_185":204,"_195":506},{"_143":599,"_139":145,"_57":600,"_147":148,"_103":601,"_150":602,"_152":-5,"_153":-5,"_154":603,"_58":605},"7a4f74db-ce2d-412d-97f6-66d2aefefb88","chlorophyll-algae","Chlorophyll and blue-green algae","Explore related instruments for chlorophyll and blue-green algae measurement.",[604,159,160],"df5b5971-b8ab-4461-9dd3-21bd164a9ff2",[162,238,606],{"_143":604,"_57":607,"_164":608,"_166":609,"_168":610,"_170":243,"_147":611,"_179":613},"ig30bga-ig30chl","IG30BGA/IG30CHL","IG30BGA/IG30CHL Algae and Chlorophyll Sensor","Fluorescence sensing enables direct monitoring of blue-green algae and chlorophyll without sample extraction or chemical reagents. Digital communication supports continuous water monitoring, with a cleaning-brush option to help manage deposits on the optical sensing surface.",{"_57":148,"_173":-5,"_166":109,"_174":-5,"_175":612},{"_103":109,"_174":-5,"_177":-5,"_178":171},{"_143":614,"_139":182,"_183":615,"_185":225,"_187":616,"_189":617,"_191":251,"_193":251,"_195":618,"_197":619,"_199":620},"e9c2938f-6236-4c7f-bf9d-752bcf98b444","2025040861512869.jpg",13520,"3a4bd3a9ba0af3bd90061177b116d1a851d9d410ca383514dfbd7fdb3aa5270f","/igenu-preview/media/3a4bd3a9ba0af3bd90061177.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.805Z",[621,623],{"_191":202,"_193":202,"_185":204,"_195":622},"/igenu-preview/media/9fb61c06fe27bcc0e9cecfd6.w